table.description:
dashboard indicator toggle period — controls how fast a status bit alternates in the CAN 0x250 message sent to the instrument cluster.

if (countdown == 0) {
    toggle_bit ^= 1;                              // flip
    countdown = CAL_display_toggle_period;         // reload
}

Used for blinking the gear display or warning indicator on the dash (e.g., flashing PRND during a fault or shift-in-progress). The type u8_time_10ms is correct.
